{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a medieval world consumed by darkness, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you are the last hope\u2014a lord tasked with saving your people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As night falls, monsters emerge, threatening your village's survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To fight back and thrive, you must rely on a mysterious magic coin pusher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push coins to summon heroes, forge weapons, and gather resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Strategically combine cards to unleash powerful effects, repel monsters, and unlock greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blending slot-machine randomness with roguelike progression, the game offers a unique experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push coins, collect resources: Trigger rewards and build your stockpile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit heroes, defend your land: Summon warriors, mages, and builders to fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synergize and upgrade: Chain card effects to unlock massive multipliers and dominate the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you save your resources for the future or risk it all for immediate gain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Lead your village through the night and into the light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lucky Lord: The Coin Pusher of Fate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a test of survival and fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ready to take the challenge?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408410?t=1745282710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745282710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408410/bde95b8a0321c61e7ec2846050273900cf9a4fca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745282710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408410/bde95b8a0321c61e7ec2846050273900cf9a4fca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745282710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3516680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a medieval world consumed by darkness, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you are the last hope\u2014a lord tasked with saving your people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As night falls, monsters emerge, threatening your village's survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To fight back and thrive, you must rely on a mysterious magic coin pusher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push coins to summon heroes, forge weapons, and gather resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Strategically combine cards to unleash powerful effects, repel monsters, and unlock greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blending slot-machine randomness with roguelike progression, the game offers a unique experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push coins, collect resources: Trigger rewards and build your stockpile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit heroes, defend your land: Summon warriors, mages, and builders to fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synergize and upgrade: Chain card effects to unlock massive multipliers and dominate the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you save your resources for the future or risk it all for immediate gain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Lead your village through the night and into the light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lucky Lord: The Coin Pusher of Fate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a test of survival and fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ready to take the challenge?</strong></p>","